  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the rule of law and anti-corruption mechanisms in the Republic of Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective: To contribute to the prevention and fight against corruption. Specific Objectives: 1.To develop zero tolerance against corruption among Moldovan citizens 2.To strengthen anti-corruption mechanisms including the investigation and prosecution mechanisms, the asset recovery functions, the declaration of assets and of conflict of interest and the prevention of corruption. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
